  "description": "Best friends for 17 years, Yeoreum and Noeul always kept things platonic—despite Noeul’s not-so-secret crush. But one impulsive birthday wish crosses a line they can’t uncross. Now Noeul’s acting like nothing happened, while Yeoreum is slowly losing it. Can their friendship survive the fallout, or is this the summer that changes everything?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
